(566248, 58358, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great image in the ''digital art'' arena.  It does a great job of maintaining photographic integrity for the most part, but the effect that creates the ''wow'' in this photo is not photographic.</td>', 'I think this is a great image in the ''digital art'' arena.  It does a great job of maintaining photographic integrity for the most part, but the effect that creates the ''wow'' in this photo is not photographic.', '2004-02-03 00:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
