(566250, 58270, 9581, '<td valign="top">WoW! How clever! Good composition!!</td>', 'WoW! How clever! Good composition!!', '2004-02-03 00:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(566251, 58386, 4967, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what you are going for here.  First off I thought maybe your title was a clue to what this had to do with your shadow, but when I looked up Palidan in the dictionary, it was not to be found.  Then I thought maybe your shadow fell somewhere across this guy... but I don''t see it.  So I guess I''m not sure what you were going for here... sorry but I''m going to have to say that this is off challenge.  Still going to give it a 4 just because it made me want to find a way to put it on challenge so it held some interest for me.</td>', 'I''m not sure what you are going for here.  First off I thought maybe your title was a clue to what this had to do with your shadow, but when I looked up Palidan in the dictionary, it was not to be found.  Then I thought maybe your shadow fell somewhere across this guy... but I don''t see it.  So I guess I''m not sure what you were going for here... sorry but I''m going to have to say that this is off challenge.  Still going to give it a 4 just because it made me want to find a way to put it on challenge so it held some interest for me.', '2004-02-03 00:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(566252, 58243, 12160, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. love the darkness and the mood in the photo. 9</td>', 'Beautiful. love the darkness and the mood in the photo. 9', '2004-02-03 00:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(566253, 58345, 4967, '<td valign="top">Is this a shadow or the sillouhette of a person?  It almost seems to be the sillouhette of someone with a bright light coming from behind it.  I can''t be sure, but if it was, this would put it off challenge.</td>', 'Is this a shadow or the sillouhette of a person?  It almost seems to be the sillouhette of someone with a bright light coming from behind it.  I can''t be sure, but if it was, this would put it off challenge.', '2004-02-03 00:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(566255, 58251, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely awesome!  I''m not sure how you did it.. but it''s great, I love the interplay of the shadow with the people, and I love the dreamy feel to it... even the composition is intriguing and that extra shadow, which I''m guessin is yours that falls across the wall or whatever you are looking out of.  I do hope we will get an explanation!  -10-</td>', 'This is absolutely awesome!  I''m not sure how you did it.. but it''s great, I love the interplay of the shadow with the people, and I love the dreamy feel to it... even the composition is intriguing and that extra shadow, which I''m guessin is yours that falls across the wall or whatever you are looking out of.  I do hope we will get an explanation!  -10-', '2004-02-03 00:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(566256, 58358, 11793, '<td valign="top">very creative, nice and crisp......well done<br/> <br/>lacks punch</td>', 'very creative, nice and crisp......well done lacks punch', '2004-02-03 00:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(566257, 58358, 4967, '<td valign="top">A mixture of humor and art all in one.  Good job of putting this together within the challenge a very creative way to do this!  Very nice job with the lighting here for the shadow... I hope we''ll get to find out what the lighting is.  Nicely done -10-</td>', 'A mixture of humor and art all in one.  Good job of putting this together within the challenge a very creative way to do this!  Very nice job with the lighting here for the shadow... I hope we''ll get to find out what the lighting is.  Nicely done -10-', '2004-02-03 00:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(566259, 58280, 7778, '<td valign="top">The pastels together with the undulating mesh textures make this a lovely juxtaposition. If the light, although well captured here, were closer to the -golden hour- the apparent narrow depth of field, I imagine, would be more dominant, and I, for one, would dance in my shirt. ;-)<br/> <br/>Nevertheless, a very satisfying capture, and a -potential great-, a fact the present title cannot reflect.</td>', 'The pastels together with the undulating mesh textures make this a lovely juxtaposition. If the light, although well captured here, were closer to the -golden hour- the apparent narrow depth of field, I imagine, would be more dominant, and I, for one, would dance in my shirt. ;-) Nevertheless, a very satisfying capture, and a -potential great-, a fact the present title cannot reflect.', '2004-02-03 00:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(566260, 58294, 4967, '<td valign="top">I guess I''m curious about whether this is really a shadow?  if it is... great job.. it almost looks like a sillouhette however that you darkened, if it is a shadow I''d be interested in seeing the lighting procedure here...</td>', 'I guess I''m curious about whether this is really a shadow?  if it is... great job.. it almost looks like a sillouhette however that you darkened, if it is a shadow I''d be interested in seeing the lighting procedure here...', '2004-02-03 00:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
