(566556, 58353, 13152, '<td valign="top">I take it from the title that this is not a manipulated image, but it it is tough to work out what a ''swimming pool projection in the wall'' might be. A very ethereal shot. The camera strap(?) even looks a little like a restrain - hence a kind of freedom and bondage juxtaposition. I like it.</td>', 'I take it from the title that this is not a manipulated image, but it it is tough to work out what a ''swimming pool projection in the wall'' might be. A very ethereal shot. The camera strap(?) even looks a little like a restrain - hence a kind of freedom and bondage juxtaposition. I like it.', '2004-02-03 05:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(566559, 58367, 13152, '<td valign="top">Clever composition and rather sinister. Very nice.</td>', 'Clever composition and rather sinister. Very nice.', '2004-02-03 05:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
