(566864, 58364, 15909, '<td valign="top">It looks like two but it is really just one shadow - nice combination of shadow and non-shadow. I also like the scary tension that adds to it - there is a before, a now and an after to this picture that makes it more than just the regular now-timeframe of a regular picture.</td>', 'It looks like two but it is really just one shadow - nice combination of shadow and non-shadow. I also like the scary tension that adds to it - there is a before, a now and an after to this picture that makes it more than just the regular now-timeframe of a regular picture.', '2004-02-03 10:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
