(566920, 58321, 11324, '<td valign="top">I really love your use of negative space.  The bulk of the interest lies within the length of the shadow, but I like the way you used the narrow ocean space to add a sort of inbalance to the balance.  Love the footprints in the sand''s forground.  Overall, very creative!  10</td>', 'I really love your use of negative space.  The bulk of the interest lies within the length of the shadow, but I like the way you used the narrow ocean space to add a sort of inbalance to the balance.  Love the footprints in the sand''s forground.  Overall, very creative!  10', '2004-02-03 11:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
