(567420, 58328, 16301, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The lighting and detail is perfect! Good luck...</td>', 'Nice idea. The lighting and detail is perfect! Good luck...', '2004-02-03 21:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(567429, 58383, 6667, '<td valign="top">I feel your desperation!!!</td>', 'I feel your desperation!!!', '2004-02-03 21:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(567434, 58341, 8624, '<td valign="top">A shapely and sexy shadow, nicely captured. I don''t care for the posterization of the colors, however and I wish your head wasn''t cut off at the top of the frame.</td>', 'A shapely and sexy shadow, nicely captured. I don''t care for the posterization of the colors, however and I wish your head wasn''t cut off at the top of the frame.', '2004-02-03 21:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(567435, 58270, 8624, '<td valign="top">neat image. I like the partial shadow hovering in the air and the lighting on the car is terrific with no distracting reflections and perfect exposure. I''ll be interested in reading about your setup for this.</td>', 'neat image. I like the partial shadow hovering in the air and the lighting on the car is terrific with no distracting reflections and perfect exposure. I''ll be interested in reading about your setup for this.', '2004-02-03 21:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(567436, 58364, 8624, '<td valign="top">very clever composition. Your shadow is well defined and I like the cropping on the cat, although I wish his head was completly in frame.</td>', 'very clever composition. Your shadow is well defined and I like the cropping on the cat, although I wish his head was completly in frame.', '2004-02-03 21:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(567437, 58243, 8624, '<td valign="top">I think this is wonderful. It''s hard for me to tell if it was a real photo or  just a digital creation but the end result works for me. The theme is clearly expressed, the grout in the tile provides great leading lines and the overall composition is a lot of fun. congrats.</td>', 'I think this is wonderful. It''s hard for me to tell if it was a real photo or  just a digital creation but the end result works for me. The theme is clearly expressed, the grout in the tile provides great leading lines and the overall composition is a lot of fun. congrats.', '2004-02-03 21:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(567438, 58323, 8624, '<td valign="top">clever title. fun capture. I wish the foreground was less cluttered with all the tall grass, though.</td>', 'clever title. fun capture. I wish the foreground was less cluttered with all the tall grass, though.', '2004-02-03 21:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(567440, 58363, 8624, '<td valign="top">this has a well defined shadow that is very expressive in its pose. I wish the subject wasn''t so crowded in the frame however.</td>', 'this has a well defined shadow that is very expressive in its pose. I wish the subject wasn''t so crowded in the frame however.', '2004-02-03 21:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(567442, 58362, 8624, '<td valign="top">the head and hand in thoughtful repose looks great but the cheesy bulb above the head spoils the shot for me.  It looks like it was hurriedly cut and pasted into the image.</td>', 'the head and hand in thoughtful repose looks great but the cheesy bulb above the head spoils the shot for me.  It looks like it was hurriedly cut and pasted into the image.', '2004-02-03 21:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(567443, 58386, 8624, '<td valign="top">this is a cool profile of you with your hat, but rather than having the entire face in shadow, I think it might have been more effective to have directed lighting where you had shadow over your eyes, for example, but the rest of the portrait was well lit. As it is, it looks more like a badly underexposed shot than an intentional effect.</td>', 'this is a cool profile of you with your hat, but rather than having the entire face in shadow, I think it might have been more effective to have directed lighting where you had shadow over your eyes, for example, but the rest of the portrait was well lit. As it is, it looks more like a badly underexposed shot than an intentional effect.', '2004-02-03 21:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(567444, 58367, 8624, '<td valign="top">great lighting, great shadows, great composition. I really like how the shadows are just created from your fingers.</td>', 'great lighting, great shadows, great composition. I really like how the shadows are just created from your fingers.', '2004-02-03 21:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(567484, 58327, 12733, '<td valign="top">You''ve come up with an interesting concept, and the execution is excellent - good lighting, textures and composition. There''s an air of mystery and a sense of not quite being sure you see what you think you see - altogether an intriguing shot.</td>', 'You''ve come up with an interesting concept, and the execution is excellent - good lighting, textures and composition. There''s an air of mystery and a sense of not quite being sure you see what you think you see - altogether an intriguing shot.', '2004-02-03 23:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(567487, 58357, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, interesting lighting and perfect technically.</td>', 'Nice idea, interesting lighting and perfect technically.', '2004-02-03 23:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(567489, 58276, 12733, '<td valign="top">You''ve created a great mood of menace and mystery.</td>', 'You''ve created a great mood of menace and mystery.', '2004-02-03 23:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(567494, 58365, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice rendering of textures and colors in the wood. I think it would have been more effective, and matched the title better, if you had a hand raised in the direction of the wood.</td>', 'Nice rendering of textures and colors in the wood. I think it would have been more effective, and matched the title better, if you had a hand raised in the direction of the wood.', '2004-02-03 23:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(567498, 58386, 12733, '<td valign="top">And now for something completely different ... How did you get the shadow to match the shirt? Great shot.</td>', 'And now for something completely different ... How did you get the shadow to match the shirt? Great shot.', '2004-02-03 23:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(567501, 58321, 12733, '<td valign="top">I really like the way the shadows seem to converge on the water. The colors are beautiful.</td>', 'I really like the way the shadows seem to converge on the water. The colors are beautiful.', '2004-02-03 23:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(567506, 58364, 12733, '<td valign="top">That cat doesn''t look all that scared. Nice concept, though, and nicely executed. The contrast between the shadow you and the real cat might have stood out better if there were some detail in her body, other than just her eye.</td>', 'That cat doesn''t look all that scared. Nice concept, though, and nicely executed. The contrast between the shadow you and the real cat might have stood out better if there were some detail in her body, other than just her eye.', '2004-02-03 23:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(567507, 58243, 12733, '<td valign="top">IMHO this would have been a much stronger shot with less empty black at the bottom. The subject is almost lost in all that black.</td>', 'IMHO this would have been a much stronger shot with less empty black at the bottom. The subject is almost lost in all that black.', '2004-02-03 23:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(567511, 58218, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute concept, nicely lighted and exposed. IMHO the shadow could have been more sharply defined, but that''s really kind of picky. Nice shot.</td>', 'Cute concept, nicely lighted and exposed. IMHO the shadow could have been more sharply defined, but that''s really kind of picky. Nice shot.', '2004-02-03 23:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(567515, 58387, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and well shot. I''m not sure what those light bulbs represent, though - is this an idea you''re getting (with a corresponding light bulb for the shadow''s idea)?</td>', 'Nice idea, and well shot. I''m not sure what those light bulbs represent, though - is this an idea you''re getting (with a corresponding light bulb for the shadow''s idea)?', '2004-02-03 23:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(567516, 58341, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the texturing, the lighting and the soft exposure and mood. And it helps to have (or be) an attractive model.</td>', 'I like the texturing, the lighting and the soft exposure and mood. And it helps to have (or be) an attractive model.', '2004-02-03 23:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(567520, 58298, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a very well-executed concept - shadow meets reality. What is supporting the flute?</td>', 'This is a very well-executed concept - shadow meets reality. What is supporting the flute?', '2004-02-03 23:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(567689, 58367, 16930, '<td valign="top">I love the way the light shows the creases in the pants with such depth, and only trace the arms with a golden outline.</td>', 'I love the way the light shows the creases in the pants with such depth, and only trace the arms with a golden outline.', '2004-02-04 00:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(567878, 58321, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition. The palm trees are a really nice touch. The long shadows makes the eyes follow the shadow toward the top of the shot. The blue of the ocean seems to distract. It would work if you cropped it out.</td>', 'Very interesting composition. The palm trees are a really nice touch. The long shadows makes the eyes follow the shadow toward the top of the shot. The blue of the ocean seems to distract. It would work if you cropped it out.', '2004-02-04 02:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(567879, 58323, 10084, '<td valign="top">The long shadow makes your eyes follow it toward the trees and the sky. This really helps to make the composition very interesting. Kind of interesting that all subjects :shadow, the grass, the trees all seem to be reaching up toward the sky. "8"</td>', 'The long shadow makes your eyes follow it toward the trees and the sky. This really helps to make the composition very interesting. Kind of interesting that all subjects :shadow, the grass, the trees all seem to be reaching up toward the sky. "8"', '2004-02-04 02:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(567881, 58276, 10084, '<td valign="top">Lighting is very good. It really helps to show off the textures on the floor and the wall. You can almost feel the roughness of the wall. The shadow definitely makes you want to know the story.<br/> <br/>Feels like it could work as a movie poster. Has an Alfred Hitchcock feeling and mood. "9"</td>', 'Lighting is very good. It really helps to show off the textures on the floor and the wall. You can almost feel the roughness of the wall. The shadow definitely makes you want to know the story. Feels like it could work as a movie poster. Has an Alfred Hitchcock feeling and mood. "9"', '2004-02-04 02:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
