(568182, 58270, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very creative, technically one of the best of the challenge.  I love studio-type stuff, so this is right up my alley.  Impressive.  Great composition, idea, and good clean whites.  10</td>', 'Very creative, technically one of the best of the challenge.  I love studio-type stuff, so this is right up my alley.  Impressive.  Great composition, idea, and good clean whites.  10', '2004-02-04 09:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(568187, 58276, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow - beautiful shot.  Very artistic - one of my favorites so far.  The detail is fabulous, as is the mood you''ve created.  I love the way the shadow pulls your eye across the image from left to right, right down the the light at the end of the street, which is exposed just enough to be bright but not overpowering.  10</td>', 'Wow - beautiful shot.  Very artistic - one of my favorites so far.  The detail is fabulous, as is the mood you''ve created.  I love the way the shadow pulls your eye across the image from left to right, right down the the light at the end of the street, which is exposed just enough to be bright but not overpowering.  10', '2004-02-04 10:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(568195, 58218, 14620, '<td valign="top">Great tones and even better expression!  Love this in B&amp;W and also the negative space works well.  Great shot!<br/> <br/>I just had to add that everytime I look at this shot it makes me laugh.  The humor here is fantastic.  Thanks for this picture!  (bumped up to a 10) :-)</td>', 'Great tones and even better expression!  Love this in B&W and also the negative space works well.  Great shot! I just had to add that everytime I look at this shot it makes me laugh.  The humor here is fantastic.  Thanks for this picture!  (bumped up to a 10) :-)', '2004-02-04 10:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(568213, 58357, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very creative and visually appealing.  The warm yellow on the ball really completes this nicely, and the sort of triangle shape that the hand makes creates a good strong dynamic compositionally, keeping the eye in the frame.  Nice work.  9</td>', 'Very creative and visually appealing.  The warm yellow on the ball really completes this nicely, and the sort of triangle shape that the hand makes creates a good strong dynamic compositionally, keeping the eye in the frame.  Nice work.  9', '2004-02-04 10:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(568221, 58321, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot that really creates a feeling of wanting to be somewhere tropical.  My eye is wishing for a touch more sharpness, but the idea and feeling conveyed are great.</td>', 'Beautiful shot that really creates a feeling of wanting to be somewhere tropical.  My eye is wishing for a touch more sharpness, but the idea and feeling conveyed are great.', '2004-02-04 10:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(568229, 58360, 5391, '<td valign="top">Simple image that speaks volumes.  Lovely tones and great detail on the wall itself, which works really nicely with the blurry shadow.  8</td>', 'Simple image that speaks volumes.  Lovely tones and great detail on the wall itself, which works really nicely with the blurry shadow.  8', '2004-02-04 10:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(568231, 58328, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, well-composed shot.  Tack-sharp, including the shadow, careful composition to get everything placed perfectly in the frame, and nice color tones.  Refreshing to see an image that has both the shadow and the person making the shadow.  9</td>', 'Beautiful, well-composed shot.  Tack-sharp, including the shadow, careful composition to get everything placed perfectly in the frame, and nice color tones.  Refreshing to see an image that has both the shadow and the person making the shadow.  9', '2004-02-04 10:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(568240, 58364, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow - Great shot, very creative and I love the title.  Composed perfectly.  8</td>', 'Wow - Great shot, very creative and I love the title.  Composed perfectly.  8', '2004-02-04 10:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(568254, 58318, 12733, '<td valign="top">This picture tells a story. It''s like a Roschach test since each viewer can probably bring whatever story he or she wants to it.</td>', 'This picture tells a story. It''s like a Roschach test since each viewer can probably bring whatever story he or she wants to it.', '2004-02-04 10:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(568257, 58390, 12733, '<td valign="top">The shadow portion is nicely composed and executed. IMHO the cluttered background behind the white surface could better be cropped out.</td>', 'The shadow portion is nicely composed and executed. IMHO the cluttered background behind the white surface could better be cropped out.', '2004-02-04 10:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(568258, 58328, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute play on words, nicely composed and lighted.</td>', 'Cute play on words, nicely composed and lighted.', '2004-02-04 10:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(568260, 58363, 12733, '<td valign="top">Neat composition, with a nice choice of background - not too plain but not obtrusive.</td>', 'Neat composition, with a nice choice of background - not too plain but not obtrusive.', '2004-02-04 10:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(568263, 58355, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but somehow it ends up looking too cluttered and confusing IMHO.</td>', 'I like the idea, but somehow it ends up looking too cluttered and confusing IMHO.', '2004-02-04 10:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(568266, 58356, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the shadow on blue background and the nice, tight composition.</td>', 'I like the shadow on blue background and the nice, tight composition.', '2004-02-04 10:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(568269, 58214, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a nice, simple composition with a "timely" message.</td>', 'This is a nice, simple composition with a "timely" message.', '2004-02-04 10:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(568272, 58383, 12733, '<td valign="top">The sense of desperation seems to come through despite the photo being but a shadow. I would probably find it more effective if I knew what it is you''re reaching for. Incidentally, I like the plain colored but textured background.</td>', 'The sense of desperation seems to come through despite the photo being but a shadow. I would probably find it more effective if I knew what it is you''re reaching for. Incidentally, I like the plain colored but textured background.', '2004-02-04 10:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(568273, 58352, 12733, '<td valign="top">Perfect placement of the shadow. What''s holding the candle up?</td>', 'Perfect placement of the shadow. What''s holding the candle up?', '2004-02-04 10:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(568276, 58371, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the shadow doesn''t look like a person. That significantly reduces the effectiveness and interest of this shot.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the shadow doesn''t look like a person. That significantly reduces the effectiveness and interest of this shot.', '2004-02-04 10:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(568280, 58323, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the second shadow beside yours and the really nice lighting on the trees.</td>', 'I like the second shadow beside yours and the really nice lighting on the trees.', '2004-02-04 10:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(568285, 58252, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the combination of the actual faces and the shadow. The left-hand and center shadow faces need more clarity to be really effective.</td>', 'I like the combination of the actual faces and the shadow. The left-hand and center shadow faces need more clarity to be really effective.', '2004-02-04 10:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(568290, 58270, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the softness of the shadow, and the way it shades off into nothing. A good contrast with the sharp rendition of the car.</td>', 'I like the softness of the shadow, and the way it shades off into nothing. A good contrast with the sharp rendition of the car.', '2004-02-04 10:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(568300, 58264, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The shape of the bird is clever. Overall, I think there''s too much in the photo - particularly the outline of what looks like an A frame that you seem to be holding up. I seems too busy, IMHO.</td>', 'Nice idea. The shape of the bird is clever. Overall, I think there''s too much in the photo - particularly the outline of what looks like an A frame that you seem to be holding up. I seems too busy, IMHO.', '2004-02-04 10:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(568301, 58345, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I think the center spot light is a tad too bright, though.</td>', 'Nice composition. I think the center spot light is a tad too bright, though.', '2004-02-04 10:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(568306, 58379, 12733, '<td valign="top">Shadows have a way of doing that. Nice exposure on the snow, but when compared to the many well-thought-out and carefully executed entries, a picture of the photographer taking his own shadow as it appears in front of him doesn''t make it.</td>', 'Shadows have a way of doing that. Nice exposure on the snow, but when compared to the many well-thought-out and carefully executed entries, a picture of the photographer taking his own shadow as it appears in front of him doesn''t make it.', '2004-02-04 10:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(568316, 58294, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting composition, and I like the textured background you''ve chosen. I assume the camera in the picture is not the one that took it.</td>', 'This is an interesting composition, and I like the textured background you''ve chosen. I assume the camera in the picture is not the one that took it.', '2004-02-04 11:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(568320, 58367, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, and including yourself - as opposed to your shadow - is a novel idea.</td>', 'Interesting composition, and including yourself - as opposed to your shadow - is a novel idea.', '2004-02-04 11:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(568324, 58362, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. What''s holding the light bulb up?</td>', 'Interesting composition. What''s holding the light bulb up?', '2004-02-04 11:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(568332, 58281, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a good compostion, and a nice capture of the snow. However, when compared to the many well-thought-out and carefully executed entries, a picture of the backlit photographer taking his own shadow as it appears in front of him doesn''t score high with me.</td>', 'This is a good compostion, and a nice capture of the snow. However, when compared to the many well-thought-out and carefully executed entries, a picture of the backlit photographer taking his own shadow as it appears in front of him doesn''t score high with me.', '2004-02-04 11:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(568339, 58372, 12733, '<td valign="top">The distant shadow is intriguing. Are you on a hilltop? Next to an object that is casting a separate shadow from yours - with very careful placement? The questions keep me looking, and the beautiful landscape in the background makes a nice picture in itself.</td>', 'The distant shadow is intriguing. Are you on a hilltop? Next to an object that is casting a separate shadow from yours - with very careful placement? The questions keep me looking, and the beautiful landscape in the background makes a nice picture in itself.', '2004-02-04 11:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(568342, 58382, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a brilliant shot, but it looks more like a negative than a shadow. Any shadows seem more incidental than integral to the picture.</td>', 'This is a brilliant shot, but it looks more like a negative than a shadow. Any shadows seem more incidental than integral to the picture.', '2004-02-04 11:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(568344, 58370, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space to create an effect.</td>', 'Nice use of negative space to create an effect.', '2004-02-04 11:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
