(569031, 58321, 7703, '<td valign="top">hehe yes this looks diffrent then where I live (iceland)</td>', 'hehe yes this looks diffrent then where I live (iceland)', '2004-02-04 19:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(569038, 58364, 7703, '<td valign="top">He dos not look sceard :)</td>', 'He dos not look sceard :)', '2004-02-04 19:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(569105, 58386, 6667, '<td valign="top">Boy!  How many people are going to remember him?  Have camera, will travel?</td>', 'Boy!  How many people are going to remember him?  Have camera, will travel?', '2004-02-04 21:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(569106, 58218, 6667, '<td valign="top">You absolutely get high marks from me for humor and literal interpretation!  I hope that hole isn''t in the kitchen counter top!!!!</td>', 'You absolutely get high marks from me for humor and literal interpretation!  I hope that hole isn''t in the kitchen counter top!!!!', '2004-02-04 21:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(569108, 58276, 6667, '<td valign="top">I like the scene and the color.  Question though:  Wouldn''t the shadow be bent at a pronounced right angle at the knees, or crotch, on the wall? The other dark area infront of the figure steals some of the show from a very neat scene.</td>', 'I like the scene and the color.  Question though:  Wouldn''t the shadow be bent at a pronounced right angle at the knees, or crotch, on the wall? The other dark area infront of the figure steals some of the show from a very neat scene.', '2004-02-04 21:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(569116, 58363, 6667, '<td valign="top">Rodan?   I am gong to make this comment in all seriousness: this shot might be more effective if the subject were not wearing clothing. . . preferablly nothing (except maybe underware).  The clothing gives the figure a round shape without dimension or too much form.  I am not sure if that is a hood of a shirt or a shoulder in back of the neck.  Also, there needs to be some negative space, in this case light, in the form to give it shape.  For example under the arm.  Hope this was helpful and not hurtfull.</td>', 'Rodan?   I am gong to make this comment in all seriousness: this shot might be more effective if the subject were not wearing clothing. . . preferablly nothing (except maybe underware).  The clothing gives the figure a round shape without dimension or too much form.  I am not sure if that is a hood of a shirt or a shoulder in back of the neck.  Also, there needs to be some negative space, in this case light, in the form to give it shape.  For example under the arm.  Hope this was helpful and not hurtfull.', '2004-02-04 21:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(569131, 58341, 13772, '<td valign="top">Wow, very sexy shadow! Is the orange suppose to be sun rays hitting the body? I like the photo but not a big fan of the effect used on the photo. Does not effect my vote though. Nice photo, Good job!</td>', 'Wow, very sexy shadow! Is the orange suppose to be sun rays hitting the body? I like the photo but not a big fan of the effect used on the photo. Does not effect my vote though. Nice photo, Good job!', '2004-02-04 21:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(569144, 58214, 13772, '<td valign="top">Good composition and a great take on the challenge. What would really make this picture really cool to me is if the watch actually looked like it was on the wrist. Meaning that it was more round. I know that would be hard but it would be cool. Like it, good job!</td>', 'Good composition and a great take on the challenge. What would really make this picture really cool to me is if the watch actually looked like it was on the wrist. Meaning that it was more round. I know that would be hard but it would be cool. Like it, good job!', '2004-02-04 21:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(569149, 58367, 13772, '<td valign="top">Very cool! The shadow looking like sun rays. I like it!</td>', 'Very cool! The shadow looking like sun rays. I like it!', '2004-02-04 21:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(569164, 58362, 13772, '<td valign="top">I like the picture and I think you get the point across without adding the lightbulb over the head. I think that it takes away from the overall picture.</td>', 'I like the picture and I think you get the point across without adding the lightbulb over the head. I think that it takes away from the overall picture.', '2004-02-04 21:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(569173, 58388, 13772, '<td valign="top">Not a big fan of that effect. It took me awhile to see what the photo was all about. The title is the only thing that helped me see the finger pointing at the groundhog. Maybe a different aproach would make this picture better.</td>', 'Not a big fan of that effect. It took me awhile to see what the photo was all about. The title is the only thing that helped me see the finger pointing at the groundhog. Maybe a different aproach would make this picture better.', '2004-02-04 22:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(569269, 58387, 772, '<td valign="top">this doesn''t maintain ''photographic integrity'' for me... = 1 ** addendum: I changed my vote on this photo because I made a bad assumption.</td>', 'this doesn''t maintain ''photographic integrity'' for me... = 1 ** addendum: I changed my vote on this photo because I made a bad assumption.', '2004-02-04 23:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(569270, 58352, 9906, '<td valign="top">This would be REALLY cool if the flame was actually being blown...<br/>TC</td>', 'This would be REALLY cool if the flame was actually being blown...TC', '2004-02-04 23:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(569271, 58362, 772, '<td valign="top">this doesn''t maintain ''photographic integrity'' for me... = 1 - addendum:  I modified my vote on this photo because I made a bad assumption.</td>', 'this doesn''t maintain ''photographic integrity'' for me... = 1 - addendum:  I modified my vote on this photo because I made a bad assumption.', '2004-02-04 23:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
