(569350, 58341, 12253, '<td valign="top">I think this was a good idea, but there are a couple of things which I think detract from its aesthetics: 1) perspective,the angle makes the head out of proportion, 2) the posterization effect; 3) the color (combined with the posterization).  <br/></td>', 'I think this was a good idea, but there are a couple of things which I think detract from its aesthetics: 1) perspective,the angle makes the head out of proportion, 2) the posterization effect; 3) the color (combined with the posterization).  ', '2004-02-05 00:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(569352, 58218, 12253, '<td valign="top">Not the best shadow, but the classiest idea here.  Good composition, tones, acting, and setup.  I hope this wins.  You have my vote.</td>', 'Not the best shadow, but the classiest idea here.  Good composition, tones, acting, and setup.  I hope this wins.  You have my vote.', '2004-02-05 00:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
