(572023, 58298, 15540, '<td valign="top">creative</td>', 'creative', '2004-02-07 17:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(572028, 58293, 15540, '<td valign="top">The Depth of field is off. The foreground looks much more blurry than the back. The affect on the brain believes it to be too blurry. Great color though. I like the shot.</td>', 'The Depth of field is off. The foreground looks much more blurry than the back. The affect on the brain believes it to be too blurry. Great color though. I like the shot.', '2004-02-07 17:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(572030, 58266, 15540, '<td valign="top">Nice nails... Very simple and yet thought provoking with the imagery.</td>', 'Nice nails... Very simple and yet thought provoking with the imagery.', '2004-02-07 17:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(572031, 58270, 15540, '<td valign="top">Wow, good job.</td>', 'Wow, good job.', '2004-02-07 17:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(572033, 58218, 15540, '<td valign="top">Very creative. I like it a lot. Like Kilroy.</td>', 'Very creative. I like it a lot. Like Kilroy.', '2004-02-07 17:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(572058, 58323, 9462, '<td valign="top">Definitely the best shadow pic of the challenge.</td>', 'Definitely the best shadow pic of the challenge.', '2004-02-07 19:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(572142, 58270, 12611, '<td valign="top">where is the center piece on that aluminum wheel?</td>', 'where is the center piece on that aluminum wheel?', '2004-02-07 21:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(572144, 58353, 12611, '<td valign="top">interesting even with the noisy pixelization. this photo keeps me looking and thinking; whicxh is not always a good thing, but this time it is.</td>', 'interesting even with the noisy pixelization. this photo keeps me looking and thinking; whicxh is not always a good thing, but this time it is.', '2004-02-07 21:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(572148, 58360, 12611, '<td valign="top">interesting. I like the shine which mimics plaster.</td>', 'interesting. I like the shine which mimics plaster.', '2004-02-07 21:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(572149, 58318, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness; interesting colors I like the daylight choice but th ebreaker box is distracting</td>', 'Nice sharpness; interesting colors I like the daylight choice but th ebreaker box is distracting', '2004-02-07 21:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(572151, 58264, 12611, '<td valign="top">nice textures. great overexposing of the ice/snow. It looks like sugar or more than that, snad on a beach in the black and white.</td>', 'nice textures. great overexposing of the ice/snow. It looks like sugar or more than that, snad on a beach in the black and white.', '2004-02-07 21:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(572226, 58276, 8367, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Good job. Bumping it up.</td>', 'I really like this. Good job. Bumping it up.', '2004-02-07 22:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(572227, 58358, 8367, '<td valign="top">Very creative. I''m not sure about the curvature but I love the paint brush effect. Good job.</td>', 'Very creative. I''m not sure about the curvature but I love the paint brush effect. Good job.', '2004-02-07 23:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(572283, 58294, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great, except for the camera in the picture.</td>', 'Great, except for the camera in the picture.', '2004-02-08 00:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(572284, 58361, 3540, '<td valign="top">Looks almost like Atlas holding up the world more than a happy face.</td>', 'Looks almost like Atlas holding up the world more than a happy face.', '2004-02-08 00:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(572285, 58357, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the rotation of perspective in this picture.  It doesn''t have a lot of drama or emotion, but at least you''ve done well giving this an interesting viewpoint.  A little more creative than the rest of the field. 7</td>', 'I like the rotation of perspective in this picture.  It doesn''t have a lot of drama or emotion, but at least you''ve done well giving this an interesting viewpoint.  A little more creative than the rest of the field. 7', '2004-02-08 00:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(572304, 58266, 16563, '<td valign="top">Nice color</td>', 'Nice color', '2004-02-08 01:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(572305, 58323, 16563, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective</td>', 'Love the perspective', '2004-02-08 01:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(572306, 58355, 16563, '<td valign="top">what''s going on in the picture? Very cool though.</td>', 'what''s going on in the picture? Very cool though.', '2004-02-08 01:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(572307, 58270, 16563, '<td valign="top">How did you do that?</td>', 'How did you do that?', '2004-02-08 01:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(572308, 58243, 16563, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting use</td>', 'Nice lighting use', '2004-02-08 02:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(572310, 58368, 16563, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect</td>', 'Very cool effect', '2004-02-08 02:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(572311, 58251, 16563, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.</td>', 'I love this picture.', '2004-02-08 02:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(572369, 58357, 10047, '<td valign="top">Creative and well done. Nice composition, color and lighting.</td>', 'Creative and well done. Nice composition, color and lighting.', '2004-02-08 08:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(572372, 58352, 10047, '<td valign="top">Well done. Too bad you couldn''t have had a slight breeze blowing the flame sidways. Creative and well executed idea.</td>', 'Well done. Too bad you couldn''t have had a slight breeze blowing the flame sidways. Creative and well executed idea.', '2004-02-08 08:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(572374, 58214, 10047, '<td valign="top">Good use of prop.</td>', 'Good use of prop.', '2004-02-08 08:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(572396, 58356, 3540, '<td valign="top">Secret agent man looks oriental.  The blue is a good background but I think its a little oversaturated. its banding in some places aroudn the top and right sidel  Good idea, good profile and a nice shot though.</td>', 'Secret agent man looks oriental.  The blue is a good background but I think its a little oversaturated. its banding in some places aroudn the top and right sidel  Good idea, good profile and a nice shot though.', '2004-02-08 09:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(572397, 58364, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good shadow. very good idea and I think its pretty well executed.</td>', 'Good shadow. very good idea and I think its pretty well executed.', '2004-02-08 09:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(572398, 58298, 3540, '<td valign="top">If only this weren''t so grainy, this would definitely be up there in the rankings.  Its just a little grainy and not quite as clear as it could be.</td>', 'If only this weren''t so grainy, this would definitely be up there in the rankings.  Its just a little grainy and not quite as clear as it could be.', '2004-02-08 09:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(572428, 58218, 2, '<td valign="top">Hilarious and well executed.  This is classic -- 10.</td>', 'Hilarious and well executed.  This is classic -- 10.', '2004-02-08 11:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(572430, 58323, 2, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.  Awesome tone and color, and a wonderful job presenting a theme.  10.</td>', 'I love this photo.  Awesome tone and color, and a wonderful job presenting a theme.  10.', '2004-02-08 11:24:45.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(572431, 58386, 2, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  I like it.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  I like it.', '2004-02-08 11:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(572432, 58298, 2, '<td valign="top">This would be much better if the wall you were shooting on were more even toned.  It might be just hte lighting, but I think it should be a uniform color.  Slightly out of focus.</td>', 'This would be much better if the wall you were shooting on were more even toned.  It might be just hte lighting, but I think it should be a uniform color.  Slightly out of focus.', '2004-02-08 11:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(572433, 58379, 2, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective.  The cool purple really makes this work.</td>', 'Simple but effective.  The cool purple really makes this work.', '2004-02-08 11:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(572434, 58380, 2, '<td valign="top">I have too much trouble figuring out what''s going on here, as the shadow isn''t very clearly defined.</td>', 'I have too much trouble figuring out what''s going on here, as the shadow isn''t very clearly defined.', '2004-02-08 11:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(572437, 58276, 2, '<td valign="top">Great choice of scenery -- this seems straight out of a movie.  I wish the shadow were a bit clearer or more obviously in a recognizable position.  Still a solid 7.</td>', 'Great choice of scenery -- this seems straight out of a movie.  I wish the shadow were a bit clearer or more obviously in a recognizable position.  Still a solid 7.', '2004-02-08 11:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(572439, 58278, 2, '<td valign="top">I like the dog in the snow much more than I like how the shadow interacts with it.</td>', 'I like the dog in the snow much more than I like how the shadow interacts with it.', '2004-02-08 11:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(572479, 58370, 14012, '<td valign="top">a bit soft</td>', 'a bit soft', '2004-02-08 12:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(572494, 58252, 14476, '<td valign="top">Doing my last look-through on th entried in this challenge and found myself enjoying this very much, so sent it up a notch.  Technically, it''s terrific.  Good luck.</td>', 'Doing my last look-through on th entried in this challenge and found myself enjoying this very much, so sent it up a notch.  Technically, it''s terrific.  Good luck.', '2004-02-08 13:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(572501, 58358, 11897, '<td valign="top">a winner for me</td>', 'a winner for me', '2004-02-08 13:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(572534, 58328, 1031, '<td valign="top">If you set up a cradle to reposition your head each time, you have a good set-up for and interesting and/or funny time-lapse sequence. If you could hold out a few days you''d get a nice "werewolf" transformation effect.</td>', 'If you set up a cradle to reposition your head each time, you have a good set-up for and interesting and/or funny time-lapse sequence. If you could hold out a few days you''d get a nice "werewolf" transformation effect.', '2004-02-08 14:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(572539, 58345, 1031, '<td valign="top">And I just bought a cheap soprano recorder last week -- before I saw this. Good idea and composition. Is the background fabric? I like the overall graininess, but something in the texture isn''t quite right for me -- I think I''m expecting a "pebbly" texture as from stucco or plaster.</td>', 'And I just bought a cheap soprano recorder last week -- before I saw this. Good idea and composition. Is the background fabric? I like the overall graininess, but something in the texture isn''t quite right for me -- I think I''m expecting a "pebbly" texture as from stucco or plaster.', '2004-02-08 14:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(572545, 58214, 1031, '<td valign="top">A great idea. Consider buying an old (broken) watchband at a secondhand store and re-shooting this, so the band could seem to disapear behind the shadow -- I think it would make it even stronger.</td>', 'A great idea. Consider buying an old (broken) watchband at a secondhand store and re-shooting this, so the band could seem to disapear behind the shadow -- I think it would make it even stronger.', '2004-02-08 14:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(572547, 58278, 17070, '<td valign="top">A nice use of descriptive text, if this dog is anything like mine then this certainly is a double shadow. Like the sharp focus</td>', 'A nice use of descriptive text, if this dog is anything like mine then this certainly is a double shadow. Like the sharp focus', '2004-02-08 14:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(572548, 58281, 1031, '<td valign="top">It wouldn''t be so bad if it just wouldn''t snow on the walkways.</td>', 'It wouldn''t be so bad if it just wouldn''t snow on the walkways.', '2004-02-08 14:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(572556, 58293, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good choice of background "subject" for this topic, since the the main subject will necessarily lack detail. Since it''s so close anyway, I might try a square crop, making your basic shapes radiate right out of the upper-right corner, instead of just off from it as it is now. It should put/keep your shadow pretty close to the 1/3 line on the left.</td>', 'Good choice of background "subject" for this topic, since the the main subject will necessarily lack detail. Since it''s so close anyway, I might try a square crop, making your basic shapes radiate right out of the upper-right corner, instead of just off from it as it is now. It should put/keep your shadow pretty close to the 1/3 line on the left.', '2004-02-08 15:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(572557, 58370, 1031, '<td valign="top">Cleverly done -- I assume it took a LOT of takes to get it "just right."</td>', 'Cleverly done -- I assume it took a LOT of takes to get it "just right."', '2004-02-08 15:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(572559, 58345, 7778, '<td valign="top">Hamelin (The Piper of -) or Hameln (the German name of the town)... (?)</td>', 'Hamelin (The Piper of -) or Hameln (the German name of the town)... (?)', '2004-02-08 15:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(572590, 58358, 17095, '<td valign="top">very well done indeed!</td>', 'very well done indeed!', '2004-02-08 16:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(572601, 58372, 1031, '<td valign="top">Great timing to get this composition. Too bad the laws of physics don''t allow your outline to be sharper.</td>', 'Great timing to get this composition. Too bad the laws of physics don''t allow your outline to be sharper.', '2004-02-08 17:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(572603, 58362, 1031, '<td valign="top">Clever application of a pretty cliched concept/</td>', 'Clever application of a pretty cliched concept/', '2004-02-08 17:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(572607, 58354, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the idea ... this looks a liitle over-sharpened though -- I think a little softer look would work here.</td>', 'I like the idea ... this looks a liitle over-sharpened though -- I think a little softer look would work here.', '2004-02-08 17:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(572608, 58243, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good job with what looks like a tricky exposure. I like the way you got the subject lined up with the foreground patterns.</td>', 'Good job with what looks like a tricky exposure. I like the way you got the subject lined up with the foreground patterns.', '2004-02-08 17:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(572615, 58294, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think this would work better without the camera. I like the overall design and lighting.</td>', 'I think this would work better without the camera. I like the overall design and lighting.', '2004-02-08 17:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(572617, 58358, 1031, '<td valign="top">Excellent angling to get the varing softness in the shadows, adding to the realism of the set-up.</td>', 'Excellent angling to get the varing softness in the shadows, adding to the realism of the set-up.', '2004-02-08 17:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(572661, 58266, 16052, '<td valign="top">Left thumb''s position mishapes nose in silhouette; hands positioned slightly higher may have helped.  Very good photograph.</td>', 'Left thumb''s position mishapes nose in silhouette; hands positioned slightly higher may have helped.  Very good photograph.', '2004-02-08 19:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(572663, 58323, 16052, '<td valign="top">Very clever.  Love the contrast and the definition of the tree limbs against the sky here.</td>', 'Very clever.  Love the contrast and the definition of the tree limbs against the sky here.', '2004-02-08 19:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(572665, 58352, 16052, '<td valign="top">Great idea, I just wish your shadow was in higher definition.</td>', 'Great idea, I just wish your shadow was in higher definition.', '2004-02-08 19:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(572667, 58357, 16052, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done - i just wish that painted wall blemish was not positioned right there at the tennis ball''s shadow.</td>', 'Very nicely done - i just wish that painted wall blemish was not positioned right there at the tennis ball''s shadow.', '2004-02-08 19:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(572669, 58218, 16052, '<td valign="top">Very clever composition.</td>', 'Very clever composition.', '2004-02-08 19:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(572693, 58366, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like this idea here. nice composition with the rough textures and thin bendy arm</td>', 'I like this idea here. nice composition with the rough textures and thin bendy arm', '2004-02-08 20:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(572695, 58365, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great textures. Very interesting mold on the bark and super profile. This is about as good as a shot like this could be. You have my vote for a ribbon with this.</td>', 'Great textures. Very interesting mold on the bark and super profile. This is about as good as a shot like this could be. You have my vote for a ribbon with this.', '2004-02-08 21:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(572696, 58372, 12611, '<td valign="top">Spectacular shot . Unfortumately the blurry shadow gives me a headache. You are blessed to live or travel to such a beautiful place.</td>', 'Spectacular shot . Unfortumately the blurry shadow gives me a headache. You are blessed to live or travel to such a beautiful place.', '2004-02-08 21:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(572698, 58370, 12611, '<td valign="top">This must have been tough work to make. It reminds me of the old thing on Electric company where one profile says half like "k"- and the other says "iss" and then they say "kiss together." I like it though. it really evokes the seventies and love.</td>', 'This must have been tough work to make. It reminds me of the old thing on Electric company where one profile says half like "k"- and the other says "iss" and then they say "kiss together." I like it though. it really evokes the seventies and love.', '2004-02-08 21:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(572699, 58327, 12611, '<td valign="top">Are those boobs? I hope they are. I am always up for giving a high score to a well endowed exhibitionist.</td>', 'Are those boobs? I hope they are. I am always up for giving a high score to a well endowed exhibitionist.', '2004-02-08 21:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(572701, 58345, 12611, '<td valign="top">isn''t it "Hamelin"- anyway, very interesting shot- it could also be entitled " snake charmer''s apprentice" I like the texture adn the center blow out. Way to keep those blacks black too, instead of brownish. Perhaps shoot the shot slightly from above.</td>', 'isn''t it "Hamelin"- anyway, very interesting shot- it could also be entitled " snake charmer''s apprentice" I like the texture adn the center blow out. Way to keep those blacks black too, instead of brownish. Perhaps shoot the shot slightly from above.', '2004-02-08 21:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(572715, 58352, 14614, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this competition - clever use of real and shadow.</td>', 'One of my favorites in this competition - clever use of real and shadow.', '2004-02-08 21:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(572740, 58341, 14012, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if you compressed too much or what, the colors are messed up. Maybe it was meant, I don''t know. This could have been a very nice photo.</td>', 'I don''t know if you compressed too much or what, the colors are messed up. Maybe it was meant, I don''t know. This could have been a very nice photo.', '2004-02-08 22:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(572817, 58382, 6477, '<td valign="top">Very creative and well excecuted, I like it...</td>', 'Very creative and well excecuted, I like it...', '2004-02-08 23:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(572820, 58266, 6477, '<td valign="top">I like the light and the colors you choose here, great shot</td>', 'I like the light and the colors you choose here, great shot', '2004-02-08 23:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(572846, 58358, 9932, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!<br/>Great idea</td>', 'Congratulations!Great idea', '2004-02-09 00:13:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(572847, 58218, 9932, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!<br/>I like the idea and shot.</td>', 'Congratulations!I like the idea and shot.', '2004-02-09 00:13:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(572848, 58386, 15751, '<td valign="top">I''m pretty sure that silhouettes count as shadows too... these voters are idiots.. i was one of your 9''s. this is a really awesome photo and deserves a way higher score!</td>', 'I''m pretty sure that silhouettes count as shadows too... these voters are idiots.. i was one of your 9''s. this is a really awesome photo and deserves a way higher score!', '2004-02-09 00:14:21.000000', NULL, 0),
