(573168, 58352, 11843, '<td valign="top">You were ROBBED!<br/>This is such a good idea. <br/>A somewhat blurry shadow is the only thing I see that hurt this photo.</td>', 'You were ROBBED!This is such a good idea. A somewhat blurry shadow is the only thing I see that hurt this photo.', '2004-02-09 08:24:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(573169, 58355, 806, '<td valign="top">Interesting how you rec''d ''over processing'' type comments on this one. I can see how people would think so. Seeing your comments on how it was done makes me amazed. I think this is a result of not enough people having had experience with the type of exhibit you were at.<br/>Sounds like a very cool place. I wonder what photographs of other shadows there would look like.<br/>The Children''s Museum in Boston has a shadow exhibit too - your shadow stays on the wall after a strobe fires off. I guess I should have gone there - your shot reminded me of it.<br/>Anyway, better luck next time. :)</td>', 'Interesting how you rec''d ''over processing'' type comments on this one. I can see how people would think so. Seeing your comments on how it was done makes me amazed. I think this is a result of not enough people having had experience with the type of exhibit you were at.Sounds like a very cool place. I wonder what photographs of other shadows there would look like.The Children''s Museum in Boston has a shadow exhibit too - your shadow stays on the wall after a strobe fires off. I guess I should have gone there - your shot reminded me of it.Anyway, better luck next time. :)', '2004-02-09 08:25:52.000000', NULL, 0),
