(573479, 58327, 16188, '<td valign="top">This has been the funniest challenge for me so far.  I was stuck in the house trying to figure out something to do with my shadow and finally came up with something I thought would work.  I, too, wish I could have gotten even more contrast but I don''t think it''s THAT hard to see the hand on the mesh!  Lol...  the best thing is that the hand, to me, looks like Mickey Mouse''s hand, not a human one, and that cracked me up.  Ominous Mickey!!!  :)<br/> <br/>Anyway, thanks for all the comments, especially the wierd ones.  :-)</td>', 'This has been the funniest challenge for me so far.  I was stuck in the house trying to figure out something to do with my shadow and finally came up with something I thought would work.  I, too, wish I could have gotten even more contrast but I don''t think it''s THAT hard to see the hand on the mesh!  Lol...  the best thing is that the hand, to me, looks like Mickey Mouse''s hand, not a human one, and that cracked me up.  Ominous Mickey!!!  :) Anyway, thanks for all the comments, especially the wierd ones.  :-)', '2004-02-09 13:45:36.000000', NULL, 0),
