(573765, 58358, 14773, '<td valign="top">I can see the debate and the different sides, but probably best left discussed on a thread. This is still the first place winner, perhaps questioning the photographer''s intention/integrity is taking away from the photo and his win.  Great job, Beagleboy, I''d imagine your portfolio is genius :-)<br/>::Lori</td>', 'I can see the debate and the different sides, but probably best left discussed on a thread. This is still the first place winner, perhaps questioning the photographer''s intention/integrity is taking away from the photo and his win.  Great job, Beagleboy, I''d imagine your portfolio is genius :-)::Lori', '2004-02-09 18:29:31.000000', NULL, 0),
