(574221, 58386, 16493, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by eaphelps:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m pretty sure that silhouettes count as shadows too... these voters are idiots.. i was one of your 9''s. this is a really awesome photo and deserves a way higher score! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Silhouettes can probably be considerd as shadows but its not YOUR SHADOW like the challenge is all about ....., and I don''t like to be called an .....!<br/>But I consider silhouettes to be underexposed subjects, not shadows, that can look good on a photo, like this photo is very good but not fitting the challenge.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-02-10 04:37:36.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by eaphelps: I''m pretty sure that silhouettes count as shadows too... these voters are idiots.. i was one of your 9''s. this is a really awesome photo and deserves a way higher score!   Silhouettes can probably be considerd as shadows but its not YOUR SHADOW like the challenge is all about ....., and I don''t like to be called an .....!But I consider silhouettes to be underexposed subjects, not shadows, that can look good on a photo, like this photo is very good but not fitting the challenge.', '2004-02-10 04:20:01.000000', '2004-02-10 04:37:36.000000', 0),
